      },
      {
        "reference": "C.-K. Li, I. Spitkovsky, and S. Shukla, Equality of higher numerical ranges of matrices and a conjecture of Kippenhahn on Hermitian pencils, Linear Algebra Appl. 270 (1998), 323–349. doi:10.1016/S0024-3795(97)00251-6."
      },
